msgid "Registered endpoints require explicit approval for anonymous access, even when the general REST API restriction is off or an IP address or namespace is allowed. Only the exact route and listed methods are approved. Visitors without existing access to a private site additionally need a local endpoint selection (GET and HEAD only). Endpoint permission checks still apply."
